 \subsubsection*{Reproducibility statement}
-The original experiments run on a single device from released code; their repository (anonymized for review) contains the training and analysis scripts, $191$ CSV run logs, and $20$ HTML summaries. Follow-up artifacts add raw diagnostics, model/optimizer/random-state checkpoints, replay checks, and the scripts for every new table and figure. Matched freezes and arithmetic branches verify shared states before intervention. Appendix~\ref{app:setup} specifies the original setup; Appendix~\ref{app:followup} gives the decoder, basis, arithmetic, and architecture-control protocols and their fixed horizons.
