 \subsubsection*{AI use statement}
 Generative AI tools assisted with the design and implementation of follow-up experiments, numerical verification, mathematical derivations, literature comparison, figure generation, and manuscript revision. The released protocols, code, checkpoints, and verification records document these analyses.
